  "question": {
    "text": "Suppose a differentiable function&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></math> satisfies the identity&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>y</mi></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>y</mi><mo>,</mo></math>&nbsp;for all real <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi></math>. If&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><munder><mi>lim</mi><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></munder><mfrac><mrow><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></mrow><mi>x</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo></math>&nbsp;then&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></msup><mfenced><mn>3</mn></mfenced></math> is equal to :"
  },
  "options": [],
  "correct_answer": "10",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8757;</mo><munder><mi>lim</mi><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></munder><mfrac><mrow><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></mrow><mi>x</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>f</mi><mo>&#39;</mo><mfenced><mn>0</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>y</mi></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>y</mi></math></p><p>Differentiate w.r.t.&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi></math>&nbsp;keeping&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi></math>&nbsp;constant</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mo>&#39;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mo>&#39;</mo><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mi>y</mi></math></p><p>put&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mo>&#39;</mo><mfenced><mn>0</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mo>&#39;</mo><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#8722;</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mo>&#39;</mo><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>&#8722;</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mo>&#39;</mo><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mo>&#39;</mo><mfenced><mn>3</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn></math>.</p>"
  }
